  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the minced beef, salt, and pepper; mix well with your hands until just combined.",
    "Dust the beef mixture with flour, then shape into 4-6 patties depending on desired size.",
    "Beat the eggs in a separate bowl and brush each patty with egg wash on both sides.",
    "Coat each patty in panko breadcrumbs, pressing gently to adhere.",
    "Heat vegetable oil in a deep frying pan to 350°F (180°C).",
    "Deep-fry the patties for 3-4 minutes per side or until golden brown and cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, prepare the slaw by combining mayonnaise, apple cider vinegar, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Serve the deep-fried patties on a banana leaf with a side of tangy slaw and your choice of toppings.",
    "Assemble the burgers by placing a cooked patty on the leaf, followed by onion, lettuce, tomato, and pickle slices."
  ],
